## Priority Order for Implementation

| Priority | Stage | Impact | Complexity |
|---|---|---|---|
| ✅ Done | Lipsync (MuseTalk) | Critical | High |
| 🔴 High | Face/Landmark Detection | High (crashes on 4K) | Medium |
| 🟡 Medium | Whisper Transcription | Medium | Low |
| 🟡 Medium | TTS Synthesis | Medium | Low |
| 🟢 Low | FFmpeg Video Encode | Low (rarely OOMs) | Low |

---

## Verification Plan

For each newly adapted stage:
1. Run a short 4K test clip
2. Confirm the stage automatically bi-sects at OOM without crashing
3. Confirm the final output is timeline-contiguous (no gaps or duplicates)
4. Confirm progress bar stays monotonically increasing
